{
    "title": "Color Water Sort Woody Puzzle",
    "description": "Color Water Sort Woody Puzzle is a fun and addictive sorting game! Try to sort the colored water in the glasses until all colors are in the same glass.  Water sort puzzle games are always on the top. With a classic style of sorting game, Color Water Sort Woody Puzzle brings definitely a challenging yet relaxing game to train your brain!\r\n\r\n\u2605 HOW TO PLAY:\r\n\u2022 Tap any glass to pour water into another glass.\r\n\u2022 The rule is that you can only pour the water if it is linked to the same color and there\u2019s enough space on the glass.\r\n\u2022 Try not to get stuck - but don\u2019t worry, you can always restart the level at any time.\r\n\r\n\u2605 FEATURES:\r\n\u2022 One finger control.\r\n\u2022 Multiple unique level with amazing themes.\r\n\u2022 FREE & EASY TO PLAY.\r\n\u2022 NO penalties & time limits; you can enjoy the Color Water Sort Woody Puzzle Game at your own pace!\r\n\r\nColor Water Sort Woody Puzzle can not only exercise your brain but also relieve your mood, which is one of the most challenging water sorting games ever.\r\n\r\nShow how smart you are! Sort it and succeed!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Color Water Sort Woody Puzzle is a fun and addictive sorting game! Try to sort the colored water in the glasses until all colors are in the same glass.  Water sort puzzle games are always on the top. With a classic style of sorting game, Color Water Sort Woody Puzzle brings definitely a challenging yet relaxing game to train your brain!<br><br>\u2605 HOW TO PLAY:<br>\u2022 Tap any glass to pour water into another glass.<br>\u2022 The rule is that you can only pour the water if it is linked to the same color and there\u2019s enough space on the glass.<br>\u2022 Try not to get stuck - but don\u2019t worry, you can always restart the level at any time.<br><br>\u2605 FEATURES:<br>\u2022 One finger control.<br>\u2022 Multiple unique level with amazing themes.<br>\u2022 FREE &amp; EASY TO PLAY.<br>\u2022 NO penalties &amp; time limits; you can enjoy the Color Water Sort Woody Puzzle Game at your own pace!<br><br>Color Water Sort Woody Puzzle can not only exercise your brain but also relieve your mood, which is one of the most challenging water sorting games ever.<br><br>Show how smart you are! Sort it and succeed!",
